sequenceDiagram
  actor visitor as "Visitor<br/>[Person]"
  box rgba(17,104,189,0.12) Cinema System (Software System boundary)
    participant ui as "Frontend<br/>[Container: TypeScript]"
    participant api as "Account API<br/>[Container: Spring Boot]"
    participant db as "Account Store<br/>[Container]"
  end
  visitor->>ui: Submits account creation form
  ui->>api: Posts email and password
  api->>db: Checks email uniqueness
  db-->>api: Returns lookup result
  alt email already taken or validation fails
    api-->>ui: Returns error response
    ui-->>visitor: Displays error feedback
  else valid new account
    api->>db: Saves new account
    db-->>api: Confirms save
    api-->>ui: Returns success response
    ui-->>visitor: Informs of success
  end
